Package: fastumi-tools-resources
Version: @CATALOG_VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: FastUMI Team <yding25@binghamton.edu>
Depends: fastumi-tools (>= @MINIMUM_TOOLS_VERSION@)
Homepage: https://github.com/KM-Data-Pipeline/FastUMI_Tools
Description: XVSDK and firmware resources for FastUMI Tools
 Versioned XVSDK packages and camera firmware artifacts used by FastUMI Tools
 on Ubuntu 20.04 Focal amd64. Files are verified against the FastUMI catalog
 before installation or flashing.
